"identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Izuho Konami was assigned to a certain prestigious prep school as a student teacher. She’s a little clumsy, but cheerful, sociable and friendly. She has never experienced romance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has two younger brothers and has certain level of skill when it comes to housework. As she had to take care of her younger brothers, she didn’t have a lot of freedom growing up. As a result, she is a little envious of people who behave freely."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her hobbies are reading manga, looking at illustrations online, and playing games. She’s kind of an indoor person. She is currently disappointed that her favorite illustrator hasn’t uploaded any new illustrations recently."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also has mixed feelings about cooperating with Ema’s requests."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"”I just don’t want to do it to see the illustrations... I think.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c104034"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/eaa852c8bb0987f7a1c13d3ff496a512b9e9ad59285e806ccced627e4f6c9587.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2264fb37d5c2b83eaac14a4de7c693d30c9de3568e9f2aeaaa278d14affebed.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚原 みう","creatorId":"vndb:s977","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s977","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s977","name":"柚原 みう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90069","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c104035","characterName":"芹沢 恵麻","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c104035"},"originalCharacterName":"芹沢 恵麻","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serizawa Ema transferred to the school as a second-year student. She is quick-witted, nimble, and is an outstanding student. She doesn’t like exercise very much but is very athletic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn’t usually show her emotions and isn’t good at expressing herself. It’s not that she thinks she doesn’t need friends, but she is often alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an only child, so she feels she has missed out on being close with others, That’s why she likes being mischievous and making physical contact."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s actually a popular illustrator and is famous online. She keeps that a secret to those around her, though. Also, she hasn’t released a new illustration recently."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In her private life, she isn’t careful about what she eats. On the contrary, she is always neat and cleans her room properly. She also prefers wearing sexy underwear."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c104035"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.